## Blog SEO Rules

Every CamCashGrl blog post should have:

* one clear primary keyword
* 3–6 secondary keywords
* unique title
* unique meta description
* canonical URL
* Article schema
* FAQ schema when FAQs are included
* visible FAQ section matching the FAQ schema
* internal links to related tools/posts
* one mid-article CTA
* one final CTA
* no duplicate H1s
* semantic heading order
* descriptive links
* image alt text when images are used

Answer the search intent in the first 150 words.

Do not keyword stuff.

Do not make unsupported income claims.

Do not write for viewers searching for sex chat, porn, free cams, live sex, or explicit content.

## Standard Blog Structure

Future CamCashGrl blog posts should generally follow this structure:

1. Metadata
2. Article schema
3. FAQ schema if needed
4. Breadcrumb
5. Article meta row
6. H1
7. Strong intro
8. Optional quick answer box
9. Optional stat cards
10. Main educational sections
11. CamCash insight block
12. Practical example or calculator-style section
13. Internal link callout
14. Mid-article CTA
15. Advanced/tactical sections
16. FAQ section
