Not every post needs every optional section, but every post should feel useful, branded, and conversion-focused.

## Blog Template Components

Prefer using reusable blog components when available, such as:

* BlogMeta
* BlogIntro
* QuickAnswerBox
* StatGrid
* InsightBox
* CalculatorBox
* WarningBox
