## Existing Post Safety

Before editing existing posts:

1. Inspect the current file.
2. Preserve useful content.
3. Preserve current routes.
4. Preserve existing schema unless replacing with an equivalent helper.
5. Do not delete existing insights unless they are duplicate, inaccurate, or off-intent.
6. Do not mass-refactor all posts in one pass without permission.
7. Run lint/build if available.
8. Summarize files changed and any issues.

## Technical Rules

* Keep one H1 per page.
* Use H2/H3 in logical order.
* Keep metadata unique.
* Keep canonical URLs correct.
* Keep mobile responsiveness.
* Add alt text to images.
* Do not add client-side code unless required.
* Do not break imports.
* Do not invent routes.
* Do not remove analytics, CTA, or internal linking sections unless replacing them with a better equivalent.
